csumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;zWk-pBPgRvXqlqxpA-VobcX7u22CA_uWhZ6kPk6Ci2sƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka0ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ZeGBa1sm7djzE6kCnJgtAN-RSbdAkfFDzV4ujK1w8MAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka0ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;8F55-8KtaCqNQjiSQLPbH9qvdCeOM2b4nNr8ZAuhNscƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkhstandardƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;CxbGGrAw6p9gs2jTelc4Mxk8UE6DBdmonCYa0RrLYtEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkhstandardƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;MG7DcCe13PYr9WX5l_Dbc4PlHeJclvMrBJf7fDQwiZwƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx$2c8ad8a3-1e36-4d60-b09a-a96a7ecc4746ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;jSrkRYpD5ZgohNDAemagU8AljvNKEE_qek5AyY1OPEAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarky!Outside the public library in Santa Ana, California, a decades-old bronze sculpture has served as the most prominent public tribute to one of Arab America's most noted civil rights figures. Commissioned in 1994 from Khalil Bendib, an artist of Algerian-American background, the work portrays Palestinian-American activist Alex Odeh with a dove resting in his outstretched hand, according to [Hyperallergic](https://hyperallergic.com/a-living-memorial-to-palestinian-activist-alex-odeh-takes-flight/).

That statue is now at the center of a participatory art project that removes the dove from its pedestal and sends it out into the broader community.

Odeh was born in 1944 in the Palestinian village of Jifna into a Catholic family, Hyperallergic reports. As a child he lived through the mass displacement that Palestinians call the Nakba; years later, as a young adult, he witnessed the Israeli military occupation of the West Bank that followed the 1967 war. He eventually immigrated to the United States, earned a graduate degree from California State University, Fullerton in 1972, and taught Arabic, according to the same source. By the early 1980s he was serving as the West Coast regional director of the American-Arab Anti-Discrimination Committee (ADC), an organization dedicated to challenging hate crimes and anti-Arab discrimination, Hyperallergic reports. Odeh's own commitments were oriented toward inter-community understanding: he actively promoted dialogue among Christians, Muslims, and Jews, and had arranged to address a nearby synagogue for Friday services, according to Hyperallergic.

He was killed before that appearance. A pipe bomb detonated at the ADC's offices in Santa Ana on October 11, 1985, taking Odeh's life, according to Hyperallergic. Journalists and federal investigators have pointed toward members of the Jewish Defense League as potentially responsible for the attack, but no one has ever faced charges, and the killing remains officially unsolved, the same source reports.

The bronze tribute has endured repeated harm since its installation, according to Hyperallergic. Red paint was thrown on it in 1996 and again in 1997; the dove was stolen more than once over subsequent years, most recently recovered and reattached in 2020. As recently as the time of Hyperallergic's report, brick debris lay strewn near the sculpture following another act of vandalism.

Artist Jon Rubin came across the statue in the spring of 2023 while completing a residency at the Grand Central Art Center in Santa Ana, and was moved enough to stay on, according to Hyperallergic. Rubin told the outlet that many people he encountered â€” among them a librarian at the site â€” had no prior knowledge of Odeh, and that it struck him how thoroughly Odeh's work had been oriented toward peace rather than animosity.

The project Rubin developed routes the dove to various individuals and organizations, each of whom hosts dinners, performances, or other gatherings over a period of several months, according to Hyperallergic. Rubin described the concept to Hyperallergic as an alternative to a fixed public monument â€” a way to make the statue's subject an occasion for shared hospitality, conversation, and collective responsibility for Odeh's legacy.

The dove was taken down from the sculpture last December with this purpose in mind, according to Hyperallergic. Attention to Odeh has grown alongside the project: a documentary tracing the circumstances of his assassination, *Stolen Dove: Who Killed Alex Odeh?*, had its debut at the Sundance Film Festival in January, the same source reports.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;F7n0IJYV-msqfQcs8m_UpGfZzMU30ZsGVefYqycGIAwƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;uajkyXEtrGoyckCKgdodM5OvYOgZfhTFIjm02AYMwMAƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;A6kJjIkSM5qeidw70pwnqwQIFWWk6RKcfd_tTLt-nWQƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;8LWiiLXTdxvkce9QFxt8V1IH5xcyoTT-QRtTg26xrZcƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxclaude-code-cli-invocationsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;teG7pBhfZ0_FNJe3r50jLxs9ODnrBeY--ksmTI8tnz4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka1ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;npXCk0fWAnD8KMYwDeMmtWFfXMg9oVYvxu1tTk72eMMƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkf80.336ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;OhqDvU6Gq0pkpf8RYjP9KNd4XYAA6KQCYpjKQfxi6U4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;2wxIZYpdhdd42LeqF5RbJHZNi8iVU7ZHEQmWYLWM79Eƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;aFuwOYNAoJ_a0J73kKX4Va8iG4TDWU-E2dyt7Nokv84ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;fBQZk7Jfpe-80kNVk8CQJwA0IPPY2gN2UmJ4cHZjcWgƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunit